      <attributes>
        <label v="Chair metal: process and appearance" />
        <description v="Ivory grey enamel on steel. CC0 Rust Coarse 01 original 8K supplies oxide microcolour/roughness/high-pass relief. 4K content tile 0.12m; physical placement remains separate in Blender. Paint and rust metallic=0, exposed steel=1. No lighting baked into colour. Heights interpreted in metres in Blender." />
      </attributes>
